// Description: Detects potential lateral movement and network pivoting using netsh portproxy (v4tov4) combined with WMIC process execution, commonly used in post-exploitation scenarios
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1090 (Proxy), T1021 (Remote Services), T1047 (WMIC)
// Data Source: DeviceProcessEvents
// Severity: High
// False Positives: IT administration scripts, network configuration tools, remote support utilities

